# Staging before main

Sealvo promotes through environment branches. `staging` comes first. `main` comes after.

- Put a change on `staging` with a pull request. Do not push to `staging` or `main` directly.
- Wait until that staging deploy is green before opening a pull request from `staging` to `main`.
- Do not merge `main` back into `staging` in order to ship production.
- Do not change `www.sealvo.it.com` DNS as part of a code promotion. That cutover is a separate decision.
